<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπρις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐδος</span>,
			ἡ, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπριν</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπριδα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			5.330
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			458
		</span></i>:—<u>Cypris</u>, a name of
		<u>Aphrodite</u>, from the island of Cyprus, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
		</span></i> ll.cc. (never in <i><span class="en">
			Od.
		</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
			Sapph.
			5.1
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Corinn.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			2.58
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κούπρι</span>), etc.; joined with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀφροδίτη</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>h.Ven.</u>
			2
		</span></i>; K. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασίλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					128.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of a
			beautiful girl, <i>a Venus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.235
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Appellat., <i>love, passion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				773
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπριν ὑφαρπάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					722
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαθραία</span> K. <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				67.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πλησμονῇ τοι</span> K. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Mon.</u>
				159
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				16.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				951
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			= sq., <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1574.24
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.125
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span> by nature; in 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> by position; never in
			Com., exc. in parodies.]</div>
